<title>ITALY: Italian mutual funds post July inflow.</title>
<headline>Italian mutual funds post July inflow.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian investment funds had a net</p>
<p>inflow of 16.007 trillion lire in July, compared with a net</p>
<p>inflow of 7.084 trillion lire in June, Assogestioni, the</p>
<p>industry body said.</p>
<p>					 July 1997     June 1997</p>
<p> Redemptions (bln lire)	  16,573	   11,144</p>
<p> Subscriptions		     32,580	   18,228</p>
<p>Net inflow, outflow (-) from:</p>
<p> Equity funds			 6,025	    2,904</p>
<p>of which Italian</p>
<p>(including specialised)	     759		 64</p>
<p>Bond funds			    9,009	    3,896</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Net inflow			  16,007	    7,084</p>
<p>-- Milan bureau +392 66129450</p>
</text>
